---
import { ShieldCheck, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-stone-100 border-t border-stone-200" aria-labelledby="about-intro-heading">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left (6 cols) -->
      <div class="reveal-slide-left lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-forest">
          About DHRIVAA
        </span>
        <h2 id="about-intro-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          An Independent Agricultural Procurement Partner in Gujarat, India
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Headquartered in western India, DHRIVAA operates at the intersection of international buyer requirements and Indian commodity extraction plants. We facilitate end-to-end sourcing mandates for bulk and containerized agricultural by-products.
        </p>

        <!-- Positioning Callout -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-stone-900">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4 text-forest flex-shrink-0" />
            <span>Fiduciary Trade Coordination</span>
          </div>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-xs text-stone-500 pl-6">
            DHRIVAA is an independent sourcing and procurement coordinator. We partner directly with vetted processing facilities across Gujarat and western India; we do not own or operate manufacturing mills.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/about-us"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-forest hover:text-forest-dark transition-colors group"
          >
            <span>Learn more about our business model &amp; approach</span>
            <ArrowRight className="w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Image: Crushing & Sourcing Facilities (6 cols) -->
      <div class="reveal-slide-right delay-100 lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-card bg-white group">
          <img
            src="/images/step-suppliers.jpg"
            alt="Agricultural commodity processing silos and storage facilities in Gujarat India"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover object-center transform transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-103"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
